 "understanding": {
  "purpose": "A weekly room-booking grid: a reader either (a) runs down one weekday column to find a free slot, or (b) reads across one time band to compare which day/room is free — it is a lookup-and-compare table, not a reading table, so the time axis and the day columns must be scannable at a glance rather than prose-legible.",
  "reading": "Top-left time label → down the column for the target day, or across the row for the target slot. Merged blocks (Mon 产品需求评审, Wed 新员工入职培训, Thu 客户方案演示 spanning 09:00–10:30+10:30–12:00 / 13:30–15:00+15:00–16:30, and the 3-column 全天 banner over Wed–Fri) tell the reader 'this room/day is taken for a longer stretch', so they must stay visually unbroken and clearly wider than a single cell.",
  "groups": [
   "Col 1 (时间段) stands alone: it is the axis every other column is read against, so its widths are set by the time token, not by content length.",
   "Cols 2–6 (周一–周五) are one family of identical role and identical header level; they should be within a few px of each other unless a column's content genuinely demands otherwise, because uneven day widths make horizontal comparison of free slots misleading.",
   "Cols 4–6 (周三/周四/周五) are additionally bound together by the single 全天 banner that spans all three; their combined width is what that one long string has to live in, so they should not be squeezed simultaneously."
  ],
  "keep_intact": [
   "Time ranges 09:00–10:30, 10:30–12:00, 13:30–15:00, 15:00–16:30, 16:30–18:00 (never split mid-token)",
   "Room codes A301, B202, B105, A301, C20 and 线上",
   "Weekday headers 周一（5/12）… 周五（5/16） on one line",
   "The ｜ separator between event name and room, and the parenthesised times inside event names (keep with their event)",
   "The 3-column banner cell as one unbroken block across 周三–周五"
  ],
  "may_wrap": [
   "Event titles: 产品需求评审（09:00–12:00）, 供应商准入评审, 研发周会（15:00–16:00）, 周例会（09:30–10:15）, 合同条款会签, 法务咨询, 项目风险同步, 数据看板…, 算法模型…, 新员工入职培训（13:30–16:30）, 客户方案演示与答疑（13:30–16:30）, 产品灰度… — these wrap to 2–3 lines without loss of meaning",
   "The 全天 banner string 2025 春季校园招聘宣讲会（09:00–17:00）｜报告厅 — it has the whole 全天 row to itself, so 2 lines there are free",
   "Wrapping inside the two-row merged blocks (Mon 09:00–12:00, Wed/Thu 13:30–16:30) costs nothing in row height, since those rows are already double height"
  ]
